  "notes": [
    "Irregular -IR verb with e→i stem change throughout the present (except nosotros) and in 3rd person preterite",
    "The i is dropped after ñ in 3rd person preterite: *riñó* (not ~~riñió~~), *riñeron* (not ~~riñieron~~)",
    "-IR e→i verbs keep the stem change in subjuntivo nosotros: *riñamos*",
    "Past participle: reñido (regular)",
    "*Reñir a alguien* = to scold/tell off someone: *El profesor nos riñe cuando llegamos tarde* = The teacher tells us off when we arrive late",
    "*Reñir con alguien* = to quarrel/fall out with someone: *Riñó con su hermano* = He fell out with his brother",
    "Related: la riña (quarrel, fight), reñido/a (hard-fought, closely contested)"
  ],
